                <note rend="inline" type="source">693.003/915: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-10-24T15:00:00-05:00">October 24, 1929—3
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>347. Your 903, October 18, 5 p.m. The Department does not perceive from your
                    telegram that any reasons exist for protesting against the application of the
                    new procedure.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
